          "raw": "{{base_url}}/check_otp_status",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "check_otp_status"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Delivery report for a sent OTP, plus whether the code is still active.\n\nDelivery receipts arrive a few seconds after the send, so the first call after /generate_otp normally reports a pending state rather than a carrier status. Poll every few seconds, and treat any DLR value beginning \"Pending:\" as \"ask again shortly\". If you would rather not poll at all, register a delivery webhook in the dashboard and we will POST each status change to you instead.\n\nData is retained for 24 hours after an OTP expires.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"message_id\": \"{{message_id}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": []
